sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant Dashboard as RHOAI Dashboard
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API
    participant Controller as odh-notebook-controller
    participant OAuthProxy as oauth-proxy sidecar
    participant Notebook as JupyterLab Container<br/>Port 8888
    participant KFP as KubeFlow Pipelines
    participant S3 as S3-compatible Storage
    participant MLflow as MLflow Tracking
    participant CodeFlare as CodeFlare SDK

    Note over User,Dashboard: User Access Flow

    User->>Dashboard: Select workbench image
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Create Notebook CR
    K8sAPI->>Controller: Watch event (Notebook CR)
    Controller->>K8sAPI: Create StatefulSet<br/>(notebook + oauth-proxy)
    K8sAPI-->>Controller: StatefulSet ready

    User->>OAuthProxy: HTTPS via OpenShift Route
    OAuthProxy->>OAuthProxy: OpenShift OAuth authentication
    OAuthProxy->>Notebook: Forward to port 8888<br/>(authenticated)
    Notebook-->>OAuthProxy: JupyterLab UI
    OAuthProxy-->>User: Rendered notebook

    Note over User,S3: User-Initiated Integrations (from notebook sessions)

    User->>Notebook: Execute notebook cell
    Notebook->>K8sAPI: kubernetes client<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
    K8sAPI-->>Notebook: Cluster resources

    Notebook->>KFP: kfp SDK<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
    KFP-->>Notebook: Pipeline status

    Notebook->>S3: boto3 client<br/>HTTPS/443 TLS
    S3-->>Notebook: Model artifacts / datasets

    Notebook->>MLflow: mlflow client<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    MLflow-->>Notebook: Experiment tracking

    Notebook->>CodeFlare: codeflare-sdk<br/>HTTP/HTTPS
    CodeFlare-->>Notebook: Distributed job status

    Note over Dashboard,Controller: Image Delivery Flow

    Note right of Dashboard: Konflux pipeline builds images<br/>with hermetic prefetch (Cachi2)
    Dashboard->>K8sAPI: Query ImageStreams<br/>label: component.opendatahub.io/name: notebooks
    K8sAPI-->>Dashboard: Available notebook images
